  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice the red onion (see ingredients). In a small bowl, combine the rice wine vinegar, salt and sugar. Scrunch the onion in your hands, then add to the pickling liquid. Add just enough water to cover the onion then stir to coat. Set aside until just before serving.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/600a4af3fe223537f32b7b09/step-b4382ef7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and rinse the chickpeas. Cut the kernels off the corn cob. Finely chop the garlic. Shred the cos lettuce (see ingredients). Roughly chop the tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/600a4af3fe223537f32b7b09/step-90e847ce.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium frying pan, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Add the corn and cook until browned, 3-4 minutes. Add the garlic, Tex-Mex spice blend (see ingredients) and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the chickpeas and the water and bring to a simmer until thickened, 3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/600a4af3fe223537f32b7b09/step-5183baac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Using a potato masher or fork, lightly mash the chickpeas until some of them have broken up and the sauce has thickened. Season to taste.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water if the chickpea mixture looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/600a4af3fe223537f32b7b09/step-a989172f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat the mini flour tortillas in a sandwich press or on a plate in the microwave for 10 second bursts, or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/600a4af3fe223537f32b7b09/step-d0b78996.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain the pickled onions. Build tacos by filling with a helping of cos lettuce, smashed chickpeas, shredded Cheddar cheese, smokey aioli, tomato and pickled onions.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/600a4af3fe223537f32b7b09/step-ca622d9e.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
